    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2Fv7vaUAbX8VWPPNsuNtn3t)_\n\nThe emoji in front of note titles in `sp-select-note` (and `sp-insert-note`) rendered larger than the text, because colour emoji fonts have taller glyphs.\n\n- New face `sp-org-tag-groups-select-emoji-face` (`:inherit default :height 0.8`, customizable); `sp-org-tag-groups-describe-note` applies it to the emoji only, not the title.\n- Doc (`.org`) and tangled `.el` edited together; CHANGELOG entry added.\n\nNot run in Emacs (none in the container). 0.8 is a guess; if it still looks off, adjust the face height.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNi8zngcAvdEufgLqZab)_",
